      "hash": "261bea0077f70a5b0c978a6e685134ad1fbb4532648723661da30e429dcacfc5"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0e4fff5995378abd1450bf721775479491bbc9d981df8f009938f568abeb1e3",
      "text": "Conclusion",
      "hash": "89db2ad881f29c18b305a20c8ed7bdffdfde49d633c27a83bd204bf9cfedaba3"
    },
    {
      "id": "b543e3d5a59cc9b95f2c54861e09543b8d420d118169282fa3c8f62ecc5d52b5",
      "text": "Up next",
      "hash": "e31da5b25f8b7324861e9aadaf5c503e7fd43e739fa3be17ebe63e999fb13df1"
    },
    {
      "id": "bef11c5e4ead85a3c8b0d88e40ad1cb5b7f56bb3f6cf7f9558705a52ee47d4d5",
      "text": "Related reading",
      "hash": "89c21c36ad5ffbab7b05ced367c46013c8d7b8ddf53a8b9739b7b2545f78abee"
    },
    {
      "id": "5df79fa4142ff50486949f0b40801aebec801608828709e3b30c94302558f21f",
      "text": "In our previous example, we saw how LLMs can call tools to do things in the world.",
      "hash": "ab761190dfd8d3a5f1f58b7846270eb9aa1366b333e9aa5667fd10a54b0337bb"
    },
    {
      "id": "fb739fb6abdb009c41f98b66ce5a3665199c161d9e199e43218fa32513489e7c",
      "text": "But they can do more than that - they can react to the information they receive from their tools.",
      "hash": "da6b66bf35e571fef63e6e70f4d78ea27247898d0ce6d6df929afc9b4b5fdd1b"
    },
    {
      "id": "c3f43f3c87515177a02b7eb2860cc03b555577f278d37bcbd36c44eee5437d50",
      "text": "This can create a powerful feedback loop where the LLM is continually grounding itself in the real world.",
      "hash": "a0b2c8b769027c55ae12add2290da1e6f5251e30f10770c840b05a2e8b238213"
    },
    {
      "id": "517ee8a8e23a51d6d75cef45986f2f0b570cf5d9b8441646b5339ea170fa0690",
      "text": "And this feedback loop is what most people, including Anthropic, call agents.",
      "hash": "42630a943baa5a673e7cd411851aeca165322a1e07c37bce9ce0aae5c7fc69dc"
    },
    {
      "id": "e826ecbe63a645238ed1348a3ffcd30f7b2a19a4d57f1afd29a85c1034159132",
      "text": "The Vercel AI SDK makes this super easy with a concept called steps.",
      "hash": "1d6699224c48f9f7183f1000e1276adb92e6f1c00969cb2bf361d8f48b22caf9"
    },
    {
      "id": "8f5841e944ee5f161f6861482780f7e0cef3ee5f764693596e4ccce160e173e9",
      "text": "We're going to make an agent that can retrieve the current weather for us at the city we specify.",
      "hash": "58488213e2f522988d53f1140968c2fb37b7e7789679b4be276fd1386f88d0ce"
    },
    {
      "id": "879e78430d71c9b10c0a025b974f69ef323e1d5f9f41e7d3514e2aeb28472a1e",
      "text": "Scrollycoding",
      "hash": "a92db14e4d481e7975b3459710fbf8ec73dcc232e366b057507f7e2891b1d6da"
    },
    {
      "id": "b65eb6f1af8f790ff2ab56ba2624df45bacccc2c1941dee4b6d5fab48010d117",
      "text": "To kick that off, we're going to create a",
      "hash": "cb2dd594691a5ace13571ae8318c65b487511dc4f65c58e062353fd07bec6177"
    },
    {
      "id": "aef1f3920e6a256b7ace673a02a9415e330b2d73588acdcfea0bf6a8bb773d87",
      "text": "tool.",
      "hash": "6aed665815d7845b7d01b2c6821d304a6ee8c28862bee6bd30eb37ece2273a4c"
    },
    {
      "id": "948538f3a8b392b4959fa2541134b497601918f1d1dc7a086ddbea744f71389a",
      "text": "We'll start by giving it a description and some parameters.",
      "hash": "35505ed94f46aabddeed69d2c297fcb4c53c2d130a97a115d6ee099238ef9608"
    },
    {
      "id": "2fbe2a242356b50cf6f2aacb1ea22679e4c85cef0dbca38a0bc19f62c869078b",
      "text": "Then we'll implement the",
      "hash": "3fc560b0705ca738895561988659b493db5ee8586b95a822bd6ed2dde8705c48"
    },
    {
      "id": "4a5507623cf799b408c730b9cc856cd3f945bf6cb5e1daab0815247170c0911b",
      "text": "function.",
      "hash": "78655d4d73de012287e630a648d3bc75193043eb45bfd031f8cd041012119e1d"
    },
    {
      "id": "7b744a1cbd09f446bcec65af03897cb8694e7de35109ddaa41900747ef3c7434",
      "text": "In this case, we're going to just stub it out by saying the weather in this city is twenty-five degrees.",
      "hash": "1808d1c856d60409884313a042fd44ae2130c8f34ec14330e1bab283957bb3f8"
    },
    {
      "id": "2a4a10cfa8c7e0da94a9e250810e99ca0c871436beda67884c6f7006561862de",
      "text": "But if we wanted to, we could call a weather API to get the actual weather.",
      "hash": "d4f4a13f270b5c90031bae982c49279de1ac17a92dd8cfe091bc04ef56959a29"
    },
    {
      "id": "4018f5cdaf241c65f853a9aa0e0ba0be4ccd08b54fcd0e410137ba4e2396337d",
      "text": "Next, we're going to hook this tool up to a function called",
      "hash": "0e621e6af9a4e5a3d772742cb6638d3715c9d02f18d935ecd04bb3c18f7ffb71"
    },
    {
      "id": "6304c7efb1eb6cc410b0bacd9394cefc41aa57a50757d7b84e9b13e4f2fb0e00",
      "text": "We'll call",
      "hash": "7e3ee3ddba371e296767d718081ca061626765eb27a1fab3aa88ebec161bd545"
    },
    {
      "id": "9b829ed321679cf5a72b0da4f47acaeb0eefa43992d130692e5121786c13b6db",
      "text": "with a model and a prompt, passing it the",
      "hash": "3501ce5a92d15c7053acae5ed4f251db1394c5656415ab552a43e32ee05aa484"
    },
    {
      "id": "cb687ed800ef5bfc6ef744caa33b99be010f55df0d6d9756cc3a4859896d3064",
      "text": "Then we'll loop over the text stream and print out the text to",
      "hash": "19642d1ef90dafc4ac4faec9ff8801d94e2903845986f22bc7741b2d3f01c22a"
    },
    {
      "id": "ec84b3949edfd5a4bee49a03ac0d7db7aa977b3473120e11d0034a42230a0c5a",
      "text": "Finally we'll ask it what the weather's like in London.",
      "hash": "9963df02026c72eeaeb631009d160590cbfcb5b4aa15d65498f838c0c44d1750"
    },
    {
      "id": "fc3f2248398c6c0ad86f2076ae5c03137b4843aa438224189639c4a9a7dfa448",
      "text": "When we run this, we notice something interesting.",
      "hash": "62687a655f95b3e9c5d34a609d0369b8804402284ac5753a044e6b2644c733a3"
    },
    {
      "id": "2b49e89041578ac05a996eb81d09d68c4373cb8543e03c86c5cea8073e8ad2ab",
      "text": "We don't get the information we're looking for; it just says, \"I'll help you.\"",
      "hash": "4eb184cbde26099c844e0bed4893c1a15d056e79742de435d68cbece1edf7408"
    },
    {
      "id": "58555783c9cefbff24f0194622612499008e91bb4ba9cf2414317612c197b84c",
      "text": "Why would this be happening?",
      "hash": "462cc17848913f86772e361db25902eb1d67860ccdeb6c632f6d30f3bfdbe5ed"
    },
    {
      "id": "03d25ba6ea933fb192841b8d62e81a2201659ce748cf71a014c5a2a13b1cab6e",
      "text": "Let's debug this using the same strategy we used last time: looking at the",
      "hash": "061c0baa5eb9d19af30cc95eb1e3fc65b7e8fe5acc70d4ec5d3562bfdffad438"
    },
    {
      "id": "8f16cc1f6028a03f3dd646e156b8c5b3e9cc35911b791c8b971c0f3c71258fdb",
      "text": "property returned from",
      "hash": "e57e7a981ff975db6506edc2230ce9a57ea5a4e96f1f977d97c424c510eb0d39"
    },
    {
      "id": "ce71bf67ad04b54b8edbbcc83d145db353a35853f131fedf227ff0ab4a37b660",
      "text": "Because we're using",
      "hash": "d515886bb8090aa7fb7fb230373aabd1db4d426591079021fd26115667a705e8"
    },
    {
      "id": "aca0ce922dcd6c334c0e98226428ad13ab0aa2c4143565c6b06ff08cfe464e62",
      "text": "we have to",
      "hash": "5e73a5ddfa2d3deaf3b08f73f61652856868939e419fd4cf29177ac7b23edc41"
    },
    {
      "id": "9b8fe3018beb1fd1e357ee7c474632d6890b13a63ee633d0b0357d02a7e9905b",
      "text": "the result of",
      "hash": "2393e249f0a3aa1eb14931832962f4a9be1e5becbd73c9fe82e4bb4f69059fb4"
    },
    {
      "id": "4e0597742e0ef7f8d2beb5cfb8485532d10538e040e7796911dcbe8d94092d9b",
      "text": "Here's",
      "hash": "372a30bd4a955b811ac15c04a60d9f59c311c4b224b39cc07f124a48bc11b51d"
    },
    {
      "id": "d380ccb3899a31bc6c4eff409f33e3feefbc0fa94a73382b771b3d202ff3f215",
      "text": "what it spits out.",
      "hash": "b7cd4ccdc43f91956f910676323d3f987b090be30da906b919785390a7c95811"
    },
    {
      "id": "aff266e6df0d339b142afe4e993f526f1cac4e660b78119796a62b272c9d1657",
      "text": "There are several things to notice about this massive blob of JSON.",
      "hash": "5dd4ece94549a977915b13dc28e2c7771e9d6df2f14ddd4b4eacf3e92961e587"
    },
    {
      "id": "49a249187c40c50059312ea4916941dfdc5b8c1a840f0e05b6ee6f40c23524f0",
      "text": "First, we notice that it's only one step long. The LLM only took one step here.",
      "hash": "e597293ec4facf7726db5b048001d316d3b5f50ba23d66e650b431504f864033"
    },
    {
      "id": "fc11c288e6177ae1fafbd0bf9afec0badc45e9a9e411a3bed0508f29198753f8",
      "text": "We can see that it called one tool and got a result back, from the",
      "hash": "c58f48f3743e2c35c62cf77465a4d8f56a42ddbe5a2c9345e1dec21dc921df88"
    },
    {
      "id": "064dc0ce526e56ad696721076577528fe5e649d90bff53dc4ea944d9b7c98b6c",
      "text": "properties.",
      "hash": "5223198f967aba1c1ba8122e86f44c51aff00093dc369ecd4cebabc8eabab32a"
    },
    {
      "id": "eb1931e12c2ec5005c9af5515de735c4d642382f45b6a8c4c8acf6b1291c593b",
      "text": "So the",
      "hash": "7c6d076c7ae0574f73818482f1c50c94a196cf765fd768765834cef9c93c62a8"
    },
    {
      "id": "20f1b34c9bf2e73b93d55432df67f1c16ad175b3155e3b4e07fe70ba016bfe8a",
      "text": "called the",
      "hash": "b1a492f11f8c50ccbd7051f5163d5abbff6e1dc695484dac7798b9338e0c7b61"
    },
    {
      "id": "6febdff8beab49d43d1495f50aec49db02caad7a74db763ef196269609c71772",
      "text": "tool with the city of London and got back the result that the weather in London is 25°C and sunny.",
      "hash": "60ae20ebe4904433e7a1e3857fcc319289acc47a6b74e7e3bfb0010aa8ebd0bb"
    },
    {
      "id": "f3cfc9bb24466a7cdbf4657670c1b9ed0e20724a10390f8bc0f2bc7b07ae20b7",
      "text": "But it then decided to stop.",
      "hash": "7df356243a98b4154a7787cfd89ca780fff875756d43eee423bd2d0850c025f1"
    },
    {
      "id": "5bd8eaba6b4bd88b5236dd0bf598f011c1741a4cf86f6002ffc95d3c75ad2d99",
      "text": "So it seems like the",
      "hash": "f202b7fc09fe492f4d62a013317e77d9f3f867f8e271e1d606ef6026f4aa34f2"
    },
    {
      "id": "912173497fe7fe209ff7ffec825754ef0aefed93b309202a3be237c962bf25b1",
      "text": "did the right thing; it called the tool but then it stopped for some reason. How do we make it take more than one step?",
      "hash": "da42fc6a8e6ecbe53ff3c9d7ac591213c12d2d694ddf414a244bac6618f0676e"
    },
    {
      "id": "6f345ce0a4d397cf51e0a91418f7616c9d851ec14f51015b854006ac19278e97",
      "text": "Go deeper:",
      "hash": "15ad3d88c6733d9b257c322d3afecc9bce2b18558171007db87598c118ca17f9"
    },
    {
      "id": "12e31017850f122d302e86bab0d16f53e65cdae3c4a68892811291af7b260258",
      "text": "join the waitlist for AI Coding for Real Engineers",
      "hash": "16c3492a8464a0859c944e287a9d433e9a2635f22a6bd8aad59f88c3e80ab732"
    },
    {
      "id": "8ab57be9b0ed1fb939de02e9fa566617b2f294a45a9fd648b1424179ad4890c8",
      "text": "By default, the AI SDK only allows the LLM to take one step.",
      "hash": "ae235ce35a0509091f68ebe50ab2cecb5a928aaaa5bb11d0842a6549374f9298"
    },
    {
      "id": "6b1a41cc372dee3c4126363955d3242066cd3549be6648d5511ddfec9a4dc696",
      "text": "If we want to allow it to take more steps, we can pass",
      "hash": "1b91fdc3088b4f582740fc408be51b190867d5bed221f6505d24f13d4dac3739"
    },
    {
      "id": "7f6f4ddcf20935353f9c80f7449dc5a05dcfaa5f181ce969d704cdb4b3d1ac41",
      "text": "This forces this loop to stop after only two steps.",
      "hash": "03ea0a7bfaf188df8d274fb7453b82038c6ad7b904fedfc4f363c94d33cd01a1"
    },
    {
      "id": "84053fd7fcd4cf6f94fb7488e3f9096f389f58710352335b0b509263129e1c2a",
      "text": "When we run this we get a really cool output:",
      "hash": "ed94eefcbf9e1905a1d362d6564cd3bd3d3f69901bdb29bd5dc64a1e0fbdefa7"
    },
    {
      "id": "08e9adaab49a95d409d3ab8a3e134261b22a35c8b84dbbe7aa1289c603f0f6eb",
      "text": "We can see that the LLM is now reacting to the information that the tool provided.",
      "hash": "330bc5e5528a2011941e4813d3734c45c40e0131de4a8942f64b1c7c05fa5d0d"
    },
    {
      "id": "873005a4a8b66f4823d639313abaced9af02d6a6b883d54fee1bcce1054a8da9",
      "text": "And if we log the steps again we can see that",
      "hash": "b3461d73776e143cef48422580008bb6f1bdccffdd5f8ad8fe8b8307e5833a8d"
    },
    {
      "id": "665774023919dff57226a1f98a0215e2f99198cdf5f868be68be82203d9f4765",
      "text": "two steps were taken",
      "hash": "d767f1a3133eb0c6fd32cf1d51e54f6dafd1cadb627463abdae980aaebd94a59"
    },
    {
      "id": "85055ac8703e283fe3d668ad526141dd4fc1a328cc7e09d2ce192eabf31c4ea1",
      "text": "What would happen if we specified more than two steps? Let's try ramping up",
      "hash": "cf0fadcd47039d007b0715ac0a8bc89a22cefcbb58cacddeb27839bfafba3791"
    },
    {
      "id": "6fcd22c1933b1b9f1cd9a65f7b508bbb5655b1d61139c2fcdd18a58cb9b42595",
      "text": "to 10 just to see what happens.",
      "hash": "607293dc39ffbd81274ee78e34a0ef08452f4474a151bb671a813e6e74a035e6"
    },
    {
      "id": "dab26d4870b0f86c7b649e6d2cd33389f2866fb467f5867c6533be82ec79c9b0",
      "text": "Turns out, we get",
      "hash": "022786ec32a97e15a56d747449eebf0d39a63e3d8b01ac6ce2357405793fc11b"
    },
    {
      "id": "30c360ccfa27d146c59bfae7e7e5312ebd7d3ed38a6f3b22812aa3d7b23ca5c3",
      "text": "nearly the same result",
      "hash": "00bb2fb2b29bc5972f7f806a4e71eae673af87db5274bf60a939eef633ae060f"
    },
    {
      "id": "b3b882ba7edd92a87f53ae0aa52bffabac02026e85e10d80ec55b73fbc80a2a1",
      "text": "The LLM stops after two steps.",
      "hash": "dcb513cf522ba02a19ed56690da74d835282ffe6f71b557673b1af41c15d259f"
    },
    {
      "id": "863edf3484a356e5ed9ef2d12f0993b28a8857f0eedd5104265104ae2b6cc2f3",
      "text": "We can see that in the second step it has a",
      "hash": "8ab45562874bd42a44fef5088383ba5ed1b85711118aa6410cfb61f51d6f11f6"
    },
    {
      "id": "a0c8b6d176da5fd7b5e6a54e93d8b3b73f771561da5b20ceb02c1c711e28ecb2",
      "text": "This is because the LLM has a built-in mechanism to stop after it has completed its task.",
      "hash": "b9293ee518b6e7eaf5fce3081876ac13a014dd48ad6c8a7c015a54e285ea8ed0"
    },
    {
      "id": "cac01baa9b71584c72fbc2ecc8af77d4a6e1fca261d7c83cd9da1f0b4521e16b",
      "text": "This means that there are two ways that this loop can complete. Either the LLM stops itself or it reaches its",
      "hash": "914da35ccb414cb168de313f68c77f20c3793cb1dd10c5f3778f37cc07e11f7e"
    },
    {
      "id": "0e5d2ddefd64a9b5c6fa15e99bd2c2d6b51a00749df8e80b77d8789dcaa222c7",
      "text": "It's not a great idea to specify",
      "hash": "1937ceec60b1bde534cd0d350dfe32b7955211b3a8348e01bec948fe790ab659"
    },
    {
      "id": "0d239812b9449e170d377a3b9fd84087de76a302cfc67110b70b7b98e188ca5f",
      "text": "because sometimes the LLM simply won't stop itself.",
      "hash": "2a5534ce64bbd87577cd76e8e6d455103d0ae028e69b337783a89bd6de7404eb"
    },
    {
      "id": "7ede85a354c375346353fda6dee72cd37dfa7cfb4de003a859c43dd2e9351aeb",
      "text": "To wrap up, we've seen how to create a simple agentic loop with the Vercel AI SDK.",
      "hash": "07a7cb437767e87f1fd6e1e2d27801d678d0df2ad857b99456928a899345e872"
    },
    {
      "id": "9e89120feac2092724a367e8be75b48abb7d3ed115f85aee08d29d08d55781bd",
      "text": "Using",
      "hash": "afe773e42fa0e8939e89e8bd489a3abcf3ce4912375aac4698e94556a0a48ddc"
    },
    {
      "id": "6fe1eb678010034d57b8cd2d959a96010ffe9fc48f694418b4ac56b058d69779",
      "text": "lets the LLM take multiple steps and react to its own tool results.",
      "hash": "8e17a20ccbfb85bf47147f2115ce5680a7a47026eba00af40ff2eb645f277b7b"
    },
    {
      "id": "8a0c371e499c2ff658e4f87338c0aab2ab711568b3c221ef8f469fa14bec1941",
      "text": "This lets you build systems that ground the LLM in reality and make it more useful.",
      "hash": "8c8834f668cd213febdf1fe5cb3cd76d2750279ec92076496e553a3deb53eef5"
    },
    {
      "id": "80f6e337def0250ab74bf042f3ead9983b521d9424050c3f53b588aa8c66b077",
      "text": "Share on X",
      "hash": "78d21bbf6b047944ec42890d28e151c61dbab35213fc65cc7be70c0c19c24407"
    },
    {
      "id": "a065a26701202b6c6c9d80bb80875631c466d559ab22eb943e94ae2c6aa76315",
      "text": "Share on Bluesky",
      "hash": "08863b88a05c60410c38c4caec5bc72535b0f01793ce6cee9171b6358b2c11da"
    },
    {
      "id": "1d3b145ef98a0ae46cb4ea769d8b3a7324f9545b1220167682dd7c7af4380172",
      "text": "Share on LinkedIn",
      "hash": "ab87c050148bd1d372e3ec3483a606127a7a1faec0f1ca5543bc3465d84fe6c9"
    },
    {
      "id": "439b74c62271771ed4dadf8960582f747c6cdaeb1a4e85e4b4bb1b5a4d467150",
      "text": "Copy URL",
      "hash": "b26d1037f1c2da31a0296d915982f12049f91bfedb998b105ce967b73a796699"
    },
    {
      "id": "f74ba2858eeb2d99292f22acaa540238de5d9696fd33f23724175b15ef1cf390",
      "text": "Previous",
      "hash": "a57b08a480b822a0a572b993391c292ede593bf8000b406675b180bbb16260fa"
